  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Commodities for Health: Ensuring Guaranteed Access and Reliability (CHEGAR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this solicitation for USAID Commodities for Health: Ensuring Guaranteed Access and Reliability (CHEGAR) activity aims to establish an effective and efficient transportation system for medical commodities via engaging the private sector to provide transport and transport management solutions. By establishing effective medical commodity transportation systems medicines will be available in health service delivery points and available for prevention testing and treatment activities.</narrative>
  </description>
